{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_0d66aa44510e46a9948364ed","type":"tool_result","content":"# Build artifacts.\n#\n# Binaries go to bin/ and are never written to the repository root: the root\n# already has a vyql/ directory (the runtime data), so a root-level `vyql` entry\n# here would match that directory and silently drop the entire knowledge base.\n#\n# The same name collision has a second edge. `go build -o vyql` from the root\n# does not fail -- vyql/ is a directory, so Go writes the binary INSIDE it, as\n# vyql/vyql. That is a 70 MB artifact sitting in the middle of the data tree.\n/vyql/vyql\n/bin/\n*.test\n*.out\n\n# Go\nvendor/\n\n# Node (script tooling)\nnode_modules/\n\n# Editor / OS\n.DS_Store\n*.swp\n.idea/\n.vscode/\n\n# Agent session data\n.claude/\n\n# Secrets\n*.env\n*.pem\n*.key\n\n# Bookkeeping from the tree-projection tooling; not part of the source.\n.public-tree-manifest\n===\n===\ngo version go1.26.8 linux/arm64","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d3b39ce-4baf-4531-a837-11deefe45eb7","uuid":"c8592f6d-ea3a-4fb0-95e4-958944182255","timestamp":"2026-09-19T05:16:20.580Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Build artifacts.\n#\n# Binaries go to bin/ and are never written to the repository root: the root\n# already has a vyql/ directory (the runtime data), so a root-level `vyql` entry\n# here would match that directory and silently drop the entire knowledge base.\n#\n# The same name collision has a second edge. `go build -o vyql` from the root\n# does not fail -- vyql/ is a directory, so Go writes the binary INSIDE it, as\n# vyql/vyql. That is a 70 MB artifact sitting in the middle of the data tree.\n/vyql/vyql\n/bin/\n*.test\n*.out\n\n# Go\nvendor/\n\n# Node (script tooling)\nnode_modules/\n\n# Editor / OS\n.DS_Store\n*.swp\n.idea/\n.vscode/\n\n# Agent session data\n.claude/\n\n# Secrets\n*.env\n*.pem\n*.key\n\n# Bookkeeping from the tree-projection tooling; not part of the source.\n.publi