{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260919140326838194c652b44ece","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Verdict written and parses. Now save the two durable environment facts to memory (they're non-obvious, cross-session, not in the repo):\n1. Push from engine worktrees is 403-blocked for all local credentials despite API push:true — campaign side publishes the branch; don't burn time retrying pushes.\n2. The sweep commits left-uncommitted work (including harness.err/harness.log/telemetry.json dirt) onto engine branches; the countermeasure is committing or dropping artifacts before a sweep tick (bab388bd97-style) — actually the cleaner memory: harness.err/harness.log are live-harness dirt that sweep commits as out-of-lane files; drop them with a commit when they land on the branch.\n\nCheck MEMORY.md first — actually I'll just write the files and append pointers. Let me check if MEMORY.md exists / what's in it.","signature":"3be748a0784a48e693e304fd"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d3b39ce-4baf-4531-a837-11deefe45eb7","uuid":"bce1f8fa-4e56-46f3-9419-6257053dd3fc","timestamp":"2026-09-19T06:03:31.724Z"}
