the 180s wall (partitioning throughput, not the memory stop).\n\n**One environment blocker, recorded verbatim in the verdict:** `git push` is 403-denied for all three available credentials (`Permission to vyprai/vyql.git denied to kikihakiem`) despite the API reporting push:true — so the remote branch still points at `7ea095b889` and PR #242 shows the old head. All six commits are local; the campaign side needs to fast-forward it, as it did for the earlier commits."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d3b39ce-4baf-4531-a837-11deefe45eb7","uuid":"7be57d27-dc33-49c3-92d0-ade31a82d504","timestamp":"2026-09-19T06:03:55.363Z"}
